Z||000000||BAM-BAM||06-21-2001||11:55 PM|||| Alright, now that Aus's sub console arrived, the only missing component is the AMP. I have been looking at a couple of options; Eclipse 3650 5 channel or an MTX 405 5 channel, both are rather expensive. What other Amps are people using? Please educate me on this. TIA<P>Peace,, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||12
